# The second output mirroring the main screen, chosen on システム環境設定's 画面サイズ page (docs/tessronos
# 10.4.8, 10.4.10), for tools/ui_run.py with UI_SCREENS=2 (QEMU's second bochs-display, right of the
# first at start). The parts are where ui_screens_out.steps says; the side's pop-up opens with the
# row chosen over the part, a row 20 high (右, 下, 左, 上, 複製). 複製 puts the size it mirrors in
# into the fields; the view is then the main screen's alone, and the second display shows the
# main screen's picture (scaled into its own size where the sizes differ). Then right of the main
# screen again.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 206 181
wait 300
click 706 184
expect sysenv: screen page 1280x800
wait 500
click 290 157
wait 300
click 290 177
expect output 2 of 2
wait 500
logmark
click 670 157
wait 300
click 670 237
wait 500
shot sm_chosen
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expectsincein 30 mirror 0
wait 1500
win システム環境設定
want ok 160 80 780 584
shot sm_main
# right of the main screen again
logmark
click 670 157
wait 300
click 670 77
wait 300
click 706 554
wait 1500
key 28
expectsincein 30 right 0
wait 800
shot sm_right
